                %p
                  is the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebra+homomorphism"} algebra homomorphism
                  given setting all generaotors
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
