            %br/
          %h3#EquDeRhamTheorem Equivariant de Rham theorem
          %p
            The point of the
            %a{:href => "#Models"} above
            dgc-algebra models is that, under suitable conditions, their
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cochain+cohomology"} cochain cohomology
            computes the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+cohomology"} real cohomology
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type"} homotopy type
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+quotient"} homotopy quotient
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo ⫽
                    %mi H
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \sslash H
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Borel+construction"} Borel construction
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %msub
                      %mo ×
                      %mi G
                    %mi E
                    %mi G
