            %p
              The point now is that the Weil model
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:WeilModel"} (11)
              for equivariant cohomology is exactly the analog of the Borel construction in terms of dgc-algebraic
              = succeed "-type" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+homotopy+theory"} rational homotopy theory
              = succeed ":" do
