            (essentially the
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Weil+homomorphism"} Chern-Weil homomorphism
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#GuilleminSternberg99"}> Guillemin-Sternberg 99, Chapter 5
            ,
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#AlbinMelrose09"} Albin-Melrose 09, Theorem 11.1
          %p
            %br/
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+localization"} equivariant localization
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+ordinary+differential+cohomology"} equivariant ordinary differential cohomology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+PL+de+Rham+complex"}> equivariant PL de Rham complex
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+PL+de+Rham+theorem"} equivariant PL de Rham theorem
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauged+WZW+model"} gauged WZW model
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+Lie+algebroid"}> action Lie algebroid
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BRST+complex"} BRST complex
          %h2#References References
          %p The Cartan model for equivariant de Rham cohomology is originally due to
          %ul
            %li#Cartan50
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Henri+Cartan"}> Henri Cartan
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em La transgression dans un groupe de Lie et dans un espace fibré principal
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicole+Berline"}> Nicole Berline
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ezra+Getzler"} Ezra Getzler
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mich%C3%A8le+Vergne"} Michèle Vergne
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Heat Kernels and Dirac Operators
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 298
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.springer.com/gp/book/9783540200628"} ISBN:9783540200628
            %li#Meinrenken03
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eckhard+Meinrenken"}> Eckhard Meinrenken
                , Section 5 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Group actions on manifolds
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.toronto.edu/mein/teaching/LectureNotes/action.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Meinrenken_GroupActionsOnManifolds.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#Meinrenken06
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eckhard+Meinrenken"}> Eckhard Meinrenken
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Equivariant cohomology and the Cartan model
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Encyclopedia of Mathematical Physics
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.toronto.edu/mein/research/enc.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/B0-12-512666-2/00344-8"} doi:10.1016/B0-12-512666-2/00344-8
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Oliver+Goertsches"}> Oliver Goertsches
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leopold+Zoller"} Leopold Zoller
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Equivariant de Rham Cohomology: Theory and Applications
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.09511"} arXiv:1812.09511
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s40863-019-00129-4"} doi:10.1007/s40863-019-00129-4
          %p Comprehensive textbook account:
          %ul
            %li#Tu20
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Loring+Tu"}> Loring Tu
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Introductory Lectures on Equivariant Cohomology
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 204
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://press.princeton.edu/books/hardcover/9780691191744/introductory-lectures-on-equivariant-cohomology"} ISBN:9780691191744
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              Camilo Arias Abad,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marius+Crainic"} Marius Crainic
              %em The Weil algebra and the Van Est isomorphism
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0901.0322"}> arXiv:0901.0322
              )
          %p Early discussion of the Weil model includes
          %ul
            %li#AtiyahBott84
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"} Raoul Bott
              = succeed "," do
                %em The moment map and equivariant cohomology
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(84)90021-1"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(84)90021-1
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.math.stonybrook.edu/~mmovshev/MAT570Spring2008/BOOKS/atiyahbott_moment.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The slick proof of the equivalence between the Weil model and the the Cartan model via the
            %em Mathai-Quillen isomorphism
            (Lemma
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ProjectionOntoHorizontalDifferentialForms"}
          %ul
            %li#MathaiQuillen86
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Varghese+Mathai"}> Varghese Mathai
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Quillen"} Daniel Quillen
              = succeed "," do
                %em Superconnections, Thom classes and equivariant differential forms
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(86)90007-8"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(86)90007-8
          %p A review of the Weil model and the Cartan model and the introduction of the “BRST model” (Kalkman model) is in
          %ul
            %li#Kalkman93
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jaap+Kalkman"}> Jaap Kalkman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em BRST model applied to symplectic geometry
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9308132"} arXiv:hep-th/9308132 (broken)
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://cds.cern.ch/record/568522"} cds:9308132
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://cds.cern.ch/record/568522/files/9308132.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jaap+Kalkman"}> Jaap Kalkman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em BRST Model for Equivariant Cohomology and Representatives for the Equivariant Thom Class
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.cmp/1104252784"} euclid:1104252784
          %p
            Generalization of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+de+Rham+theorem"} equivariant de Rham theorem
            to non-compact Lie groups is due to
          %ul
            %li#Getzler94
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ezra+Getzler"}> Ezra Getzler
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Equivariant Chern Character for Non-compact Lie Groups
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1006/aima.1994.1081"} doi:10.1006/aima.1994.1081
          %p
            based on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+de+Rham+complex"} simplicial de Rham complex
          %ul
            %li#BottShulmanStasheff76
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Raoul+Bott"}> Raoul Bott
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Herbert+Shulman"} Herbert Shulman
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jim+Stasheff"} Jim Stasheff
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the de Rham theory of certain classifying spaces
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0001-8708(76)90169-9"} doi:10.1016/0001-8708(76)90169-9
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/82496263.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+de+Rham+cohomology"} equivariant de Rham cohomology
            with emphasis on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/characteristic+forms"} characteristic forms
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+equivariant+differential+cohomology"} ordinary equivariant differential cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+K%C3%BCbel"}> Andreas Kübel
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+Thom"} Andreas Thom
                %em Equivariant characteristic forms in the Cartan model and Borel equivariant cohomology
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1508.07847"}> arXiv:1508.07847
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+K%C3%BCbel"}> Andreas Kübel
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+Thom"} Andreas Thom
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Equivariant Differential Cohomology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1510.06392"} arXiv:1510.06392
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/tran/7315"} doi:10.1090/tran/7315
          %p
            Review with emphasis on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+localization"} equivariant localization
            formulas:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vasily+Pestun"}> Vasily Pestun
              ,
              %em Review of localization in geometry
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.02954"}> arXiv:1608.02954
              ), chapter in:
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vasily+Pestun"} Vasily Pestun
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Maxim+Zabzine"} Maxim Zabzine
              (eds.)
              = succeed "," do
                %em Localization techniques in quantum field theories
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1751-8121/aa63c1"} doi:10.1088/1751-8121/aa63c1
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.02952"} arXiv:1608.02952
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://pestun.ihes.fr/pages/LocalizationReview/LocQFT.pdf"} full pdf
          %p
            Discussion in relation to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/resolution+of+singularities"} resolution of singularities
          %ul
            %li#AlbinMelrose09
              Pierre Albin,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Melrose"} Richard Melrose
              %em Equivariant cohomology and resolution
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0907.3211"}> arXiv:0907.3211
              )
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              Hugo Garcia-Compean, Pablo Paniagua,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernardo+Uribe"} Bernardo Uribe
              %em Equivariant extensions of differential forms for non-compact Lie groups
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1304.3226"}> arXiv:1304.3226
              )
          %p
            Some related discussion for equivariant
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riemannian+geometry"} Riemannian geometry
            in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Michor"}> Peter Michor
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Basic Differential Forms for Actions of Lie Groups
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "ttps://www.jstor.org/stable/2161476"} jstor:
          %p
            Discussion in the broader context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+ordinary+differential+cohomology"} equivariant ordinary differential cohomology
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              Andreas Kübel,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+Thom"} Andreas Thom
              = succeed "," do
                %em Equivariant Differential Cohomology
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/tran/7315"} doi:10.1090/tran/7315
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1510.06392"} arXiv:1510.06392
          %p
            Discussion in the context of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauged+WZW+model"} gauged WZW model
          %ul
            %li#Witten92
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                , appendix of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On holomorphic factorization of WZW and coset models
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.cmp/1104249222"} EUCLID
            %li#FigueroaOFarrillStanciu94
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jos%C3%A9+Figueroa-O%27Farrill"}> José Figueroa-O'Farrill
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sonia+Stanciu"} Sonia Stanciu
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gauged Wess-Zumino terms and Equivariant Cohomology
                %strong 341
                (1994) 153-159 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9407196"}> arXiv:hep-th/9407196
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(94)90304-2"} doi:10.1016/0370-2693(94)90304-2
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jos%C3%A9+de+Azc%C3%A1rraga"}> José de Azcárraga
                , J. C. Perez Bueno,
                %em On the general structure of gauged Wess-Zumino-Witten terms
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9802192"}> arXiv:hep-th/9802192
                )
          %p
            Discussion in view of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry"} supersymmetry
          %ul
            %li#GuilleminSternberg99
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Victor+Guillemin"}> Victor Guillemin
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shlomo+Sternberg"} Shlomo Sternberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supersymmetry and equivariant de Rham theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-662-03992-2"} doi:10.1007/978-3-662-03992-2
            %li#Miettinen96
              %p
                Mauri Miettinen,
                %em Weil Algebras and Supersymmetry
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9612209"}> arXiv:hep-th/9612209
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://cds.cern.ch/record/317377"} cds:317377
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/427720"} spire:427720
          %p
            Discussion in relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+K-theory"} equivariant K-theory
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} equivariant elliptic cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michel+Duflo"}> Michel Duflo
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mich%C3%A8le+Vergne"} Michèle Vergne
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cohomologie équivariante et descente
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/book-part/AST_1993__215__5_0"} numdam:AST_1993__215__5_0
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mich%C3%A8le+Vergne"}> Michèle Vergne
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Bouquets revisited and equivariant elliptic cohomology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.00312"} arXiv:2005.00312
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0129167X21400127"} doi:10.1142/S0129167X21400127
          %p
            Generalization to equivariant-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+de+Rham+cohomology"} twisted de Rham cohomology
            (as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/codomain"} codomain
            for the
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+equivariant+Chern+character"} twisted equivariant Chern character
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Varghese+Mathai"}> Varghese Mathai
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Danny+Stevenson"} Danny Stevenson
              = succeed "," do
                %em Chern character in twisted K-theory: equivariant and holomorphic cases
              %strong 236
              (2003) 161-186 (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0201010"}> arXiv:hep-th/0201010
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-003-0807-7"} doi:10.1007/s00220-003-0807-7
